ent-MobLavalandHivelord = hivelord
    .desc = A truly vile creature that spews from tendril nests and carpet mines alike.
ent-MobLavalandHivelordBrood = hivelord brood
    .desc = A fresh spawn of the hivelord, still weak but quick and angry.
ent-MobLavalandGutlunch = gutlunch
    .desc = Named by the first miner to witness one of them gobble down a goliath's exposed guts.
ent-MobLavalandBasilisk = basilisk
    .desc = A territorial creature that keeps its victims frozen in place.
ent-MobLavalandLobstrosity = lobstrosity
    .desc = A monstrous lobster corrupted by lava and radiation, always hungry.
ent-FoodMeatGutshank = gutshank
    .desc = A bird leg of questionable origin. Surprisingly filling.
ent-FoodMeatLobster = lobster meat
    .desc = Rich meat from a monstrous lobster. The lava gave it a spicy aftertaste.
petting-success-gutlunch = The gutlunch clucks happily at you.
